  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/803/848/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>加入我们的 Discord 服务器以获取抢先预览和模组建议 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fe4qnrE7bS6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/e4qnrE7bS6</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h4><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌻 简介</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Sunflower Delight 是《Farmer's Delight》的一个附属模组，添加了向日葵籽相关产品以及更多内容！&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></h4>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建议搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a>&nbsp;游玩，以便在游戏中查看配方和食物属性。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<h4><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📖 主要特性</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>两格高花朵的新用途。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增食物、食材和饮品。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增用于高效存储向日葵籽的方块。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增带有特殊效果的头饰。（该效果可在“游戏规则”中禁用）</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📝 翻译</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>俄语和英语 -&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/karobka8/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Karobka8</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>乌克兰语 -&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/rikot/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rikot</a></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>简体中文 -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/jun_nature/followers\" rel=\"nofollow\">jun_nature</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如果您希望将本模组翻译为您的语言，请随时联系我！</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔩 兼容性</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Diet</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-central-kitchen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create: Central Kitchen</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Botania</strong></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon-repraised\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon: Repraised</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📰 许可与常见问题<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>只要下载链接指向此 CurseForge 页面，您即可在视频和整合包中使用本模组。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>禁止将此模组重新上传至其他网站和启动器，也不得在其他项目中使用任何本模组的资源。</strong></span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>💡 结语</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如果您有任何建议或修正，欢迎随时提出！也许正是您的想法将影响未来的更新。祝您游戏愉快！ </strong></span></p>",
